{"title":"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_12\">Problem 12</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 12\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/3/983442cbc5b9b3d60ac8a250c0a02d891f763364.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_7 \\Big(\\log_3 (\\log_2 x) \\Big) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"180\" height=\"32\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/5/48506fb84bd0d20d735e5c08f6f3b570970940cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{-1/2}$\" width=\"40\" height=\"16\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/1/0513ed2ea426f53f81074641ba9f4da60425ee05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} \\ \\frac{1}{3} \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)} \\ \\frac{1}{2 \\sqrt 3} \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{3\\sqrt 3}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{42}}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"524\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/3/983442cbc5b9b3d60ac8a250c0a02d891f763364.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_7 \\Big(\\log_3 (\\log_2 x) \\Big) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"180\" height=\"32\" />, we deduce <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/3/62337c20eab6cdf69ab973dc98f2d7681a6c8733.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_3 (\\log_2 x) =1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/3/aa3f96a090e2440f3dd14ba6509f4df3b49fb9cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2 x=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"80\" height=\"19\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/f/ccf5d650726be49af3a306c54a2fd7dd1d628b48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=8$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/b/f2b10a1e4562b87ede4bcca3ac2e6669d9092b48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{-1/2}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"101\" height=\"41\" />. Since this does not match any of the answer choices, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/e/43e68a4b4dd24ddd20fa615c52137f2b1b992e2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{{\\bf(E)} \\text{none of these}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME\" title=\"1983 AHSME\">1983 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1983 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1983\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width